  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-13T05:23:21.848Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if it were possible to dynamically scale the avatar, adjusting the view position and IPD accordingly.\nCurrently, there's a \"Set View\" component, which seems like it would work, but in fact scaling the avatar root the calling \"set view\" does not in fact adjust the view position or IPD (at least on desktop mode). It's not clear if this use cases is the intended one for \"Set View\", and this seems like it might have IK side effects as well - so rather than request that \"Set View\" support this use case, I'd simply like to suggest that this be supported somehow and leave it up to you guys to figure out how best to support this kind of operation.",
